# The three step system prompts do NOT live in this repository. They are product
# logic, this repository is public, and their home is the BuildShip repo - the
# private workflow `service-runpipeline-THIN`, where ARCHITECT_SYSTEM /
# GENERATOR_SYSTEM / REVIEW_SYSTEM are node inputs. No copy is kept here: a
# local copy goes stale and can then be deployed over the live prompt, which is
# exactly what had happened to the Architect prompt. These rules stay so that a
# re-created copy cannot be committed by accident.
BUILDSHIP_ARCHITECT_SYSTEM_PROMPT_UPDATED.txt
BUILDSHIP_GENERATOR_SYSTEM_PROMPT_UPDATED.txt
BUILDSHIP_REVIEW_SYSTEM_PROMPT.txt
BUILDSHIP_REVIEW_SYSTEM_PROMPT_UPDATED.txt
/graphify-out
/.playwright-mcp

